# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your knowledge of tools for handling noise and errors and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr "Ambil peperiksaan 20 soalan di laman IBM Training untuk menguji pengetahuan anda tentang alat mengendalikan hingar dan ralat serta menerima lencana melalui Credly."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam  | Tools for quantum advantage"
msgstr "Peperiksaan | Alat untuk kelebihan kuantum"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam and badge {#exam-and-badge}"
msgstr "Peperiksaan dan lencana {#exam-and-badge}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A square badge stating the name of this course, foundational level, and issued by IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/tools-for-quantum-advantage/badge.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A square badge stating the name of this course, foundational level, and issued by IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/tools-for-quantum-advantage/badge.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Uji pengetahuan anda {#test-your-knowledge}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button below to navigate to IBM Training, where you can take the badging exam for General formulation of quantum information.\n"
msgstr "Selepas melengkapkan bacaan dan aktiviti dalam kursus ini, klik butang di bawah untuk menuju ke IBM Training, di mana anda boleh mengambil peperiksaan lencana untuk General formulation of quantum information.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be sent to the email you used to register with IBM Training.\n"
msgstr "Peperiksaan ini terdiri daripada 20 soalan, dan anda mesti menjawab sekurang-kurangnya 16 dengan betul untuk lulus. Setelah menerima skor lulus, lencana anda akan dihantar secara automatik ke e-mel yang anda gunakan untuk mendaftar dengan IBM Training.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan anda bersedia untuk mengambil peperiksaan. Jika anda tidak mendapat skor lulus dalam dua percubaan, peperiksaan akan dikunci buat sementara waktu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notice: These exams on the IBM Training site may be temporarily unavailable in the next few days, due to maintenance.\n"
msgstr "Notis: Peperiksaan ini di laman IBM Training mungkin tidak tersedia buat sementara waktu dalam beberapa hari akan datang, kerana penyelenggaraan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<LaunchExamButton href=\"https://www.ibm.com/training/course/tools-for-quantum-advantage-badge-quiz-DL46113G\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be viewed [here](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/).\n"
msgstr "NOTIS: IBM menggunakan perkhidmatan Credly, pemproses data pihak ketiga yang diberi kuasa oleh IBM dan terletak di Amerika Syarikat, untuk membantu pentadbiran program Lencana Digital IBM. Untuk mengeluarkan Lencana Digital IBM kepada anda, maklumat peribadi anda (nama, alamat e-mel, dan lencana yang diperoleh) akan dikongsi dengan Credly. Anda akan menerima pemberitahuan e-mel daripada Credly dengan arahan untuk menuntut lencana. Maklumat peribadi anda digunakan untuk mengeluarkan lencana anda dan untuk tujuan pelaporan program dan operasi. IBM mungkin berkongsi maklumat peribadi yang dikumpulkan dengan anak syarikat IBM dan pihak ketiga di seluruh dunia. Ia akan dikendalikan dengan cara yang selaras dengan amalan privasi IBM. Kenyataan Privasi IBM boleh dilihat [di sini](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/).\n"
